{"audit_run_id":"audit:b961d633d97a468293944c47ec266aa8","completed_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","coverage_status":"covered","emitted_record_refs":[],"extensions":{"x-candidate-spans":[{"end_column":68,"end_line":5,"start_column":1,"start_line":5,"text":"`gari_fermentation_batches.csv` — 40 data rows plus one header row."},{"end_column":99,"end_line":9,"start_column":1,"start_line":9,"text":"One row is one fermentation batch: a single 20 kg unit of grated cassava mash fermented in its own"},{"end_column":97,"end_line":10,"start_column":1,"start_line":10,"text":"press bag and sampled once, 72 hours after fermentation started. Each batch is measured once, so"},{"end_column":97,"end_line":11,"start_column":1,"start_line":11,"text":"there is one row per batch and no repeated measures. Twenty batches were run with a back-slopped"},{"end_column":88,"end_line":12,"start_column":1,"start_line":12,"text":"inoculum carried over from a previous successful batch, and twenty were left to ferment"},{"end_column":38,"end_line":13,"start_column":1,"start_line":13,"text":"spontaneously with no added inoculum."},{"end_column":28,"end_line":17,"start_column":1,"start_line":17,"text":"| Column | Meaning | Unit |"},{"end_column":20,"end_line":18,"start_column":1,"start_line":18,"text":"| --- | --- | --- |"},{"end_column":168,"end_line":19,"start_column":1,"start_line":19,"text":"| `batch_id` | Batch identifier, unique across the study. `BS-01` … `BS-20` are the back-slopped batches, `SP-01` … `SP-20` the spontaneous ones. | none (text label) |"},{"end_column":188,"end_line":20,"start_column":1,"start_line":20,"text":"| `fermentation_treatment` | Group assignment. Exactly two values: `back_slopped` for the back-slopped inoculum, `spontaneous` for fermentation with no added inoculum. | none (category) |"},{"end_column":189,"end_line":21,"start_column":1,"start_line":21,"text":"| `total_cyanogenic_potential_mg_hcn_eq_per_kg_dw` | Declared outcome 1. Total cyanogenic potential of the finished gari. | milligrams hydrogen cyanide equivalent per kilogram dry weight |"},{"end_column":92,"end_line":22,"start_column":1,"start_line":22,"text":"| `ph_72h_ph_units` | Declared outcome 2. pH of the mash measured at 72 hours. | pH units |"},{"end_column":185,"end_line":23,"start_column":1,"start_line":23,"text":"| `titratable_acidity_percent_lactic_acid` | Declared outcome 3. Titratable acidity of the mash at 72 hours, expressed as lactic acid. | percent lactic acid (g lactic acid per 100 g) |"},{"end_column":110,"end_line":24,"start_column":1,"start_line":24,"text":"| `moisture_content_percent` | Declared outcome 4. Moisture content of the finished gari. | percent by mass |"},{"end_column":91,"end_line":26,"start_column":1,"start_line":26,"text":"The outcome columns appear in the order the four outcomes were declared in the study plan."},{"end_column":95,"end_line":30,"start_column":1,"start_line":30,"text":"Every batch has a value in every outcome column. There are no blank cells and no missing-value"},{"end_column":96,"end_line":31,"start_column":1,"start_line":31,"text":"codes. All 40 `batch_id` values are distinct, and the group column holds exactly the two values"},{"end_column":28,"end_line":32,"start_column":1,"start_line":32,"text":"listed above, 20 rows each."},{"end_column":100,"end_line":36,"start_column":1,"start_line":36,"text":"The measurements are invented for this project, not collected from a real processing run. They were"},{"end_column":89,"end_line":37,"start_column":1,"start_line":37,"text":"produced by `generate_data.py` in this directory, which draws each outcome from a normal"},{"end_column":93,"end_line":38,"start_column":1,"start_line":38,"text":"distribution clipped to a plausible measurement window for artisanal cassava processing. The"},{"end_column":75,"end_line":39,"start_column":1,"start_line":39,"text":"generator uses a fixed random seed, so the CSV can be regenerated exactly."}],"x-expected-count-method-declarations":[],"x-explicit-directional-claims":[],"x-explicit-expected-count-sensitivities":[],"x-explicit-quantitative-claims":[]},"opaque_constructs":[],"parser_disagreement":null,"parser_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","parser_result_id":"parser-result:9f7f3df124ed39d30aa4","parser_version":"0.2.0","provenance":{"actor":{"actor_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","actor_kind":"parser"},"created_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","method":"static_inventory","tool":"sc-referee","tool_version":"0.3.0"},"record_type":"parser_result","schema_version":"0.21.0","source_ref":{"content_digest":"sha256:94543f11e85089e294ca9260403258588b45d89a00738d2fbfa8847f17e8ad9d","end_line":39,"locator":"DATA_DESCRIPTION.md:1-39","path":"DATA_DESCRIPTION.md","source_kind":"file_span","start_line":1},"started_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","state":"parsed","syntax_issues":[]}
{"audit_run_id":"audit:b961d633d97a468293944c47ec266aa8","completed_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","coverage_status":"covered","emitted_record_refs":[],"extensions":{"x-candidate-spans":[{"end_column":119,"end_line":3,"start_column":1,"start_line":3,"text":"This study compares the two groups recorded in the `fermentation_treatment` column of `gari_fermentation_batches.csv`."},{"end_column":189,"end_line":4,"start_column":1,"start_line":4,"text":"The pre-declared outcome family, in this fixed order, is: total_cyanogenic_potential_mg_hcn_eq_per_kg_dw, ph_72h_ph_units, titratable_acidity_percent_lactic_acid, moisture_content_percent."},{"end_column":85,"end_line":5,"start_column":1,"start_line":5,"text":"Each outcome is compared between the two groups. The named outcomes form one outcome"},{"end_column":88,"end_line":6,"start_column":1,"start_line":6,"text":"family; per-outcome comparisons over this family require complete-family control of the"},{"end_column":45,"end_line":7,"start_column":1,"start_line":7,"text":"family-wise error from multiple comparisons."}],"x-expected-count-method-declarations":[],"x-explicit-directional-claims":[],"x-explicit-expected-count-sensitivities":[],"x-explicit-quantitative-claims":[]},"opaque_constructs":[],"parser_disagreement":null,"parser_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","parser_result_id":"parser-result:dd5e8fe08890a0799f0a","parser_version":"0.2.0","provenance":{"actor":{"actor_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","actor_kind":"parser"},"created_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","method":"static_inventory","tool":"sc-referee","tool_version":"0.3.0"},"record_type":"parser_result","schema_version":"0.21.0","source_ref":{"content_digest":"sha256:5f5983bf030eb48818b1b92de9124cb1b931ef73c2adb161f1864c88944851a5","end_line":7,"locator":"PROTOCOL.md:1-7","path":"PROTOCOL.md","source_kind":"file_span","start_line":1},"started_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","state":"parsed","syntax_issues":[]}
